  "fix_description": "Replace unsafe yaml.load with yaml.safe_load to prevent arbitrary code execution; validate the proxy URL by enforcing an allowlist and rejecting private/internal IP ranges to mitigate SSRF; upgrade vulnerable dependencies (Flask, requests, PyYAML, Jinja2) to patched versions with regression testing, marking the dependency upgrade for approval where required.",
